- **Annual Leave**  
  - All full‑time employees receive **20 days of paid annual leave** each calendar year.  
  - Leave requests must be submitted through the HR portal **at least 5 working days in advance**.  
  - Unused annual leave can be carried forward to the next year, but **no more than 5 days** may be transferred.

- **Sick Leave** (separate from annual leave)  
  - Employees are entitled to **10 paid sick days** per year.  
  - If you are sick for **more than 2 consecutive days**, a medical certificate must be provided.

